<h2>Documentation That Supports a Dallas Hail Claim</h2>
<p>Good documentation ties the damage to a specific storm and shows the full scope of repairs. Our <a href="/claim-documentation-checklist/">claim documentation checklist</a> walks through this step by step.</p>
